{"unit_id":"Dreftian__Opencode-Connect#card-zh","repo":"Dreftian/Opencode-Connect","commit":"cbb25d851a967cfbd710ada2aead6c9c3544c267","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"OpenCode Connect（DSH 模型提供方）：将本机 OpenCode 模型接入 DeepSeek Harness。它向 DSH 注册 opencode 提供方，启动时发现模型并定时刷新目录；默认同步 CLI 返回的模型，也可配置为只同步免费模型。用户可在 DSH 中选择模型，通过本机 OpenCode CLI 生成，并接收文本和推理流。遇到速率限制时会按退避策略重试。适合希望在 DSH 中使用 OpenCode 模型的用户。需要本机 OpenCode CLI 或指定 cliPath，无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:26-74","src/adapter.ts:91-135","src/adapter.ts:141-185","src/opencode-client.ts:331-360","src/opencode-client.ts:503-555"]}
